message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names. See "Citation metadata" in the contributing guide of the
  documentation for who is an author and how to add or correct your entry.
title: TRS-Filer
abstract: >-
  TRS-Filer is a registry of tools and workflows for projects, networks and
  infrastructures that implements the GA4GH Tool Registry Service (TRS) API,
  so that clients such as workflow engines and execution services can find
  tools and workflows, their versions and tool classes, and fetch their
  descriptors, test files, container image definitions and other files.
  Additional endpoints register, update and delete tools, tool versions and
  tool classes. It is built with FOCA and deployed with Docker Compose or its
  Helm chart.
